@title 3D vents: a big flow gets a wide grille that runs along the wall
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet with T1 at 600 W (fixture made by qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py): the cooling selection proposes a large flow. The grille offered with it is no longer a 400 mm square cut short by the shallow wall but a wide one that runs along the wall, and the card says so if even that is short. The run is finished before the shot.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-big-flow.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 150
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
expect "A grille of about"
shot 01-big-flow-card
check_layout
check_blank 01-big-flow-card
